---
// PLATE M — the memory plugin behind the slot (fig. 01 of /plugins/memory/).
// Rebuilt 2026-10-02 against localharness main @ 98682e4. The v0.9.0 drawing (write gates,
// predictive gate, chapter-writer, visibility line) described modules deleted in the
// resonance rebuild (spec 05 banner) and is retired. Left: what CORE owns and calls — the
// loop asks the memory slot each turn inside a ContextBudget; the registry, slash table, CLI
// mount and the phone's memory screen are the surfaces. Hairline: the slot boundary. Right:
// what the PLUGIN owns (memory/plugin.py and the modules it constructs). Badges ①–⑤ = one
// turn: ask → contained call → load within budget → sections back → the model calls a tool;
// dreaming runs while idle. Sources: docs/specs/09 "The memory slot", 00 §5, memory/*.py
// module docstrings (spec 05 names them ground truth), CHANGELOG 0.16.0 Known limitations.
// Marker ids p2-*. SVG at lg+; FlowLedger below.
import FlowLedger from './FlowLedger.astro';
